		<!-- Control 0x04: +/0/0 C [Restore Factory Defaults] -->
		<!-- Control 0x05: +/0/0 C [Restore Brightness and Contrast] -->
		<!-- Control 0x08: +/0/0 C [Restore Factory Default Color] -->

